      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَامُوسٌ</span></b>  The <i>sea;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْرٌ</span>; (IDrd, K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَمِيسٌ</span></b> : (O:) or the <i>deepest part</i> thereof:
(A 'Obeyd, A, K:) or the <i>main body of the
water</i> thereof; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْمَسٌ</span></b> : (K, A, TA:) or
